  my addOne(47, "evening", "Day 47 Evening Ledger", "Tonight's question: Thank your wife for one specific thing she has done during this. Thank God for one too.\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies told today (#): what, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n3. Corrections made (#)\n4. The trigger: who, where, and the fear (failure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: \"If I tell the truth, ___ will happen.\"\n6. What actually happened when I told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment and the true sentence I'll say\n8. One line of prayer or thanks")
  my addOne(48, "morning", "Day 48 Morning: Your ongoing system", "Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\nDecide what keeps running after Day 49. Keep: the nightly ledger, the Sunday review, counseling until your counselor says otherwise, and a weekly text to your brother. Optional: the midday check.\n\nBefore you go: name today's risk moment and the exact true sentence you'll say.")
